{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423335001:1":{"text":"꼬마 친구, 왜 여기서 혼자 울고 있나요? 다른 친구들은요? 어른들이 걱정하고 계세요. 얼른 돌아가요.","source_cn":"小朋友，你怎么一个人在这里哭呀？你的朋友呢？大人很担心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F91EA36C9B5F5A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423335002:1":{"text":"...흑, 귀신 잡기 놀이를 하고 있었는데, 친구들이 너무 빨리 도망쳐서 금방 사라져 버렸어요. 도저히 따라갈 수 없었다고요!","source_cn":"……呜……我们在玩扮鬼抓人的游戏，可是他们跑得好快，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF60CE9526EF26D59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423335003:1":{"text":"간신히 주르를 찾았는데 걔도 도망갔고... 못 찾으면 계속 찾아야 한단 말이에요! 그런데 혼자서는 너무 무서워서...","source_cn":"好不容易找到了朱尔，可是朱尔又跑掉了……追不上他们，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x688B2873A8B87C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423335004:1":{"text":"저희가 친구들 찾는 걸 도와주면 집에 갈래요?","source_cn":"如果我们帮你找到朋友的话，你是不是就愿意回家了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBD2661418DBC84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423335005:1":{"text":"사실 저도 집에 가고 싶어요. 그런데 혼자서 가면 안될 것 같고, 혼자 갈 수도 없을 거 같아요...","source_cn":"其实我现在就想回家了，只是我不能丢下他们，我也不敢一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05BE3C6AA4B79A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1423335005":{"text":"사실 저도 집에 가고 싶어요. 그런데 혼자서 가면 안될 것 같고, 혼자 갈 수도 없을 거 같아요...","source_cn":"其实我现在就想回家了，只是我不能丢下他们，我也不敢一个人回去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05BE3C6AA4B79A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423335006:1":{"text":"고맙습니다. 저 혼자서 너무 무서웠어요. 얼른 친구들을 찾아주세요. 같이 돌아가고 싶어요!","source_cn":"谢谢你们，我好害怕一个人，你们快点找到他们，把他们带回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF609F8AE370301EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"우리도 같이 놀아줄게","source_cn":"我们也来玩游戏","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x156A5A2D51E4F3D3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리도 같이 놀아줄게","female":"우리도 같이 놀아줄게","variant_male_record_index":"73910","variant_female_record_index":"73911","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"우리도 같이 찾아줄게","source_cn":"我们帮你找到他们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5E17CA4F31D8A81B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리도 같이 찾아줄게","female":"우리도 같이 찾아줄게","variant_male_record_index":"73912","variant_female_record_index":"73913","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","sour